        "title": "ITU Green Digital Action: a call for a common method to score software's carbon intensity",
        "bodyHtml": "The International Telecommunication Union, the United Nations specialised agency for information and communication technologies, set out a call to action at COP28 for an agreed methodology for deriving the carbon intensity of software and the corresponding carbon efficiency, so that a consistent approach can be determined. ISO/IEC 21031 (SCI) is a methodology of this kind.",
        "tags": [],
        "ctaText": "View source",
        "ctaHref": "https://www.itu.int/initiatives/green-digital-action-atcop28/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2023/12/Call-to-Action-Pillar4-Green-standards.pdf"
